.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbit-logout 1  "logout " 
.SH NAME
orbit\-logout \- Sign this device out. Unsynced changes wait for the next login
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit logout\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sign this device out. Unsynced changes wait for the next login
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object per result, with `"v":1`, instead of text
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Log out even with unsynced changes
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable ANSI colors
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  orbit logout \-\-dry\-run
  orbit logout \-\-yes
